When you kill an enemy, their death forms a cursed magical pattern on the ground. This creates a circle of radius [1, 2, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] which blinds enemies and deals them [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage, while giving you 2 positive energy per turn. The circle lasts for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.

The duration of the circle can be increased by a critical hit.

The blind chance increases with your Spellpower.

You can activate this talent to draw the pattern in your own blood, creating it underneath you at the cost of 5% of your maximum life.
